              "value": "Take this response as input - {{$context.$nodes.TRANSACTIONS_FILTER_GET_TASK_ID.$output.result}}\n\nInside this response try to look for TaskId. fetch the first taskId that is found in this response.\n\nTake this response as secondInput - {{$context.$nodes.WORKERS_INFORMATION_REASSIGN.$output.items}}\n\nTake this response as userNameInput - {{$context.$nodes.TRANSACTION_ACTION_IDENTIFIER.$output.assignTo}}\n\nLook inside secondInput and search for object with attribute \"UserName\" and if it matches userNameInput then fetch PersonId from the same object. \n\nReturn both taskId and personId."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"TaskIdAndPersonId\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"TaskId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"personId\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"TaskId\", \"personId\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
